<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty flat at 2.8600 vs dollar.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty flat at 2.8600 vs dollar.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland said it fixed the zloty flat at 2.8600 to the dollar and 1.8435 to the mark, down from Friday's 1.8405.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
